# Hollow (Necromancy) spell names + descriptions.
spell-cause_fear = Cause Fear
spell-cause_fear-desc = You stir a sudden, gnawing dread of death in one creature within sight, gripping it with fear of you. The undying and the soulless feel nothing of this terror.
spell-bestow_curse = Bestow Curse
spell-bestow_curse-desc = With a baleful touch you lay a withering hex on a single creature, sapping its body and fortune for as long as you hold focus.
